stateDiagram-v2

    [*] --> Q0
    Q0 --> H: h
    H --> HT: t
    HT --> HTT: t
    HTT --> HTTP: p

    HTTP --> HTTPS: s
    HTTP --> COLON: colon
    HTTPS --> COLON: colon

    COLON --> SLASH1: slash
    SLASH1 --> SLASH2: slash

    SLASH2 --> DOMAIN: alphanumeric

    state DOMAIN {
        [*] --> DomainProcessing
        DomainProcessing --> DomainProcessing: letter, digit, hyphen, dot
    }

    DOMAIN --> PATH_START: valid TLD then slash
    DOMAIN --> ACCEPT: valid TLD then end
    DOMAIN --> DEAD: invalid character or bad hyphen or invalid TLD

    PATH_START --> PATH_SEG: path character
    PATH_START --> ACCEPT: trailing slash

    PATH_SEG --> PATH_SEG: path character
    PATH_SEG --> PATH_START: slash

    DEAD --> DEAD: any